  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nGiven: (46 B 8) A 16 C 15 B 3 D 27 =?\n\n(46 B 8) A 16 C 15 B 3 D 27 =? ⇒ (46 × 8) ÷ 16 + 15 × 3 - 27 =?\n\n⇒ __**(46 ×**____** 8)**__ ÷ 16 + 15 × 3 - 27 =?\n\n⇒ __**368**____** ÷**____** 16**__ + 15 × 3 - 27 =?\n\n⇒ 23 + __**15 **____**×**____** 3**__ - 27 =?\n\n⇒ __**23**____** + 45**__ - 27 =?\n\n⇒ __**68**____** - 27**__ =?\n\n⇒ 41 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
